"num_games_owned": 101, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 54633, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 152, "playtime_at_review": 2478, "last_played": 1787372952, "avatar": "7684f0bb4ea73e5832e27c2d8a14d95a72cbdae7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Things I like:\n- The developers have an amazing sense of humor and it is reflected in the game, especially the lore.\n- The devs are highly receptive to customer feedback.\n- Immersive & addictive gameplay.\n- The game coherently introduces/explains new things to you, especially when you're starting out.\n- The art style is unique. The low-poly models and vibrant colors fit together well.\n- The voice cast is hilarious & fun to listen to.\n- Good music.\n- Good variety in the amount of missions & assignments you complete.\n- Procedurally generated levels means no mission will be ever be the same twice.\n- The Abyss Bar legitimately makes me hungry and/or thirsty.\n- The community is polite and equally as humorous as the devs.\n- There are options, but not so many that you'll become overwhelmed.\n- Mod-friendly, which I consider to be a positive even though I don't use them. It gives more freedom to players.\n\nThings I don't like:\n- No option to customize voices or eye colors.\n- Some cosmetics clip through others rather obviously. This occurs most frequently with beards & mustaches.\n- There's no point to drinking Burning Love when you can have Flinlocke's Delight instead.\n\nOverall:\nThis is a very well-executed FPS with a unique gameplay format, a suprisingly effective vistual style, a healthy community with a healthier relationship with the dev team, and a fitting & impeccable sense of humor that not many games have nowadays.\n\nBuy this game. Don't question it, you will have a good time, and you can thank me later.", "timestamp_created": 1681599483, "timestamp_updated": 1681599483, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}